**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      CONTROL WORD EXECUTE SUBROUTINE                               *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   THE CW EXECUTE SUBROUTINE IS CALLED BY THE LOAD ROUTINE
*            AND BY THE VERIFY MODE OF THE VERIFY AND PREPARE TO LOAD
*            ROUTINE.
*
*            WHEN USED BY THE LOAD ROUTINE, THIS SUBROUTINE LOADS THE
*            DATA PREPARED BY THE VERIFY AND PREPARE TO LOAD ROUITNE,
*            INTO THE MEMORY LOCATIONS SPECIFIED BY THE CONTROL WORDS
*            WHAT WERE ALSO PREPARED IN THAT PROGRAM.
*
*            WHEN CALLED BY THE VERIFY PORTION OF THE VERIFY AND
*            PREPARE TO LOAD ROUTINE, HTE CW EXECUTE SUBROUTINE USES
*            THE PREVIOUSLY PREPARED CONTROL WORDS TO OBTAIN THE
*            REQUIRED INFORMATION FROM MEMORY.

* ENTRIES    CWS      CALLED FROM LOAD AND VERIFY AND PREPARE TO LOAD

       ORG     MDSRT,D.DATA
CWSRT  BSS     1
CWPTR  BSS     1

       USE     DAT
CWCLA  CDS     LVBUF
       CLA     LVBUF
       USE     INST

CWS    STO     777
       CLA     777
       STO     CWSRT

       CLA     LDPEND
       TNZ     CWS1         LOADING                                   Q

*      VERIFYING                                                      B
       CLA     775          PLACE CONTROL WRD TO BE EXECUTED IN       N
*                           ACCUMULATOR                               N
       HOP     IEDA
       HOP     CWSRT        EXIT HOP TO CR                            X

*      LOADING                                                        B
CWS1   CLA     CWCLA                                                  Y
       STO     CWPTR

CWS2   CLA     CWPTR
       ADD     D.KB20
       HOP     IEDA         PICKUP DATA TO LOAD                       P
       STO     775

       CLA     CWPTR
       HOP     IEDA         PICKUP CTRL WORD TO LOAD                  P
       HOP     IEDA         EXEC CTRL WORD AND LOAD                   P

       CLA     CWPTR        UPDATE CNTR ALLOWING PICKUP OF SEQ LOC IN B
       ADD     D.KB19       TEMP STOR                                 B
       STO     CWPTR

       CLA     LDPEND
       SUB     D.KB19
       STO     LDPEND
       TNZ     CWS2         ALL WORDS LOADED                          Q

       HOP     CWSRT        EXIT HOP TO CR                            X
